  "displayName": "Technically Technicolor DRT",
  "description": "Technicolor CMY dye film emulation DRT. Models Cyan, Magenta, Yellow, and Black dye plates with per-plate hue bending, density rolloff, high/low density controls, grain pooling, and halation. Full GPU acceleration on macOS (Metal) and Windows/Linux (CUDA).",
