  "releaseNotesUrl": "https://github.com/Dec18studios/Technically-Technicolor-DRT/releases/tag/v12.2.1",
  "releaseHighlights": "- Editors follow the clip: with Follow clip on, the Film Stock Editor, Textures and Dye Designer jump to the matching Technicolor DRT node when you change clips (Mac and Windows)\n- New node picker in each editor to step between Technicolor DRT nodes on the clip, plus Link to grab the right node when the editor is pointing somewhere else\n- Live preview light: a small dot shows Live, Connecting or Not live, with a note on how to turn on Resolve's external scripting if it isn't connected (Mac and Windows)\n- Fixed edits from one node sometimes saving to a different node\n- Windows: the viewer always catches up to your last edit, and the Film Stock Editor now gets live preview too\n- The Preset Manager lists your PhotoChemist presets (read only), including PhotoChemist Full presets under Full Neg\n- Mac: editor windows remember where you put them\n- Mac: editors always open in dark mode, and Textures and the Film Stock Editor open in Single View on the page you asked for\n- Mac: the Dye Designer now scrolls and resizes like the other editors",
